1
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:05,340
(Sheldon:)Here's a fun Postal fact.

2
00:00:05,363 --> 00:00:07,573
Yeah, the inside of our mailbox

3
00:00:07,597 --> 00:00:09,347
(Sheldon:)is under federal jurisdiction.

4
00:00:09,369 --> 00:00:11,419
(Sheldon:)So, if you broke
my right thumb,

5
00:00:11,439 --> 00:00:13,199
(Sheldon:)that's Pasadena city police.

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,080
(Sheldon:)But if you broke
my left thumb,

7
00:00:15,105 --> 00:00:16,665
(Sheldon:)that's the FBI.

8
00:00:18,232 --> 00:00:20,692
(Leonard:)If I'm going to jail, I'm killing him,
not breaking his thumb.

9
00:00:20,717 --> 00:00:21,997
(Leonard:)No.

10
00:00:22,292 --> 00:00:24,772
(Sheldon:)Oh, I got a letter
from my Meemaw.

11
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:26,470
(Sheldon:)Umm. Smell this.

12
00:00:27,541 --> 00:00:28,261
(Penny:)What is that?

13
00:00:28,351 --> 00:00:30,991
(Sheldon:)Uh, roses, bengay,
and Dr. Schools' foot powder.

14
00:00:31,937 --> 00:00:34,207
Yeah, "Grandma",
by Calvin Klein.

15
00:00:36,325 --> 00:00:38,255
Yeah, the last time I got
a hand written letter,

16
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:41,450
(Penny:)it was from someone who told me
I parked like a blind person.

17
00:00:41,477 --> 00:00:43,027
(Leonard:)That someone has a name.

18
00:00:43,048 --> 00:00:44,718
(Sheldon:)Uh, thank you.

19
00:00:46,581 --> 00:00:48,631
(Sheldon:)Oh, Meemaw got
a new set of teeth.

20
00:00:49,881 --> 00:00:51,621
(Sheldon:)Oh, but then
she found her old ones.

21
00:00:52,895 --> 00:00:55,245
(Sheldon:)Oh, so now the new ones are
just gonna be her church teeth.

22
00:00:57,287 --> 00:00:59,217
(Leonard:)Fun. Like your
Comic-Con Spock ears

23
00:00:59,237 --> 00:01:01,137
(Leonard:)and your around
the house Spock ears.

24
00:01:03,502 --> 00:01:05,392
I park fine!

25
00:01:08,282 --> 00:01:10,082
(Sheldon:)Oh, my goodness,
she's coming to visit!

26
00:01:10,084 --> 00:01:12,514
(Leonard:)Oh, it'll be nice
to finally meet her.

27
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,290
(Sheldon:)Oh, you are going
to love her.

28
00:01:14,288 --> 00:01:17,088
(Sheldon:)She is the kindest, sweetest
woman you'll ever meet.

29
00:01:17,091 --> 00:01:19,991
Yeah, unless you're a gopher
digging up her vegetable garden.

30
00:01:21,162 --> 00:01:22,392
(Sheldon:)In that case, you can expect

31
00:01:22,397 --> 00:01:25,727
(Sheldon:)to have your head bashed in
with a shovel.

32
00:01:25,733 --> 00:01:29,373
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

